[00:00.000] 作词 : Paper Blush
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Paper Blush
[00:16.646]Somewhere on the shore of a lake​
[00:21.077]A cottage on a misty lake​
[00:25.428]A melancholy bird looking at me​
[00:29.980]Singing me a song​
[00:34.310]The song goes like this be yourself​
[00:38.691]Don't worry about others do as you like​
[00:43.244]Everyone is looking at you​
[00:46.187]Don't worry do what you want​
[00:52.080]The lake heard everything​
[00:56.343]The lake heard everything​
[01:00.778]The lake heard everything​
[01:05.278]The lake heard everything​
[01:09.432]I'm a bit tired today​
[01:13.866]I just wanna drink some wine​
[01:16.197]And do some laundry afterwards​
[01:19.818]I'll sleep for a long time without worrying​
[01:29.024]My consciousness sinks into the darkness​
[01:33.365]My body gradually becomes paralyzed​
[01:38.637]My soul gradually comes back to me​
[01:46.669]My consciousness returns​
[01:49.770]My body is no longer paralyzed​
[01:55.591]My soul has returned to my body​
[01:59.444]Now I'll sing a song to the lake
[by:别偷我电瓶了啊]
[00:16.646]湖畔某隅​
[00:21.077]薄雾湖上，立着小舍​
[00:25.428]一只染了愁绪的鸟，静静凝望着我​
[00:29.980]为我低吟一支歌​
[00:34.310]歌声轻落：你只管做自己就好​
[00:38.691]别被旁人的目光绊了脚，随心而行便好​
[00:43.244]纵使所有目光，都落在你身上​
[00:46.187]也无需慌，去做你心底想做的事​
[00:52.080]湖水听尽了一切​
[00:56.343]湖水听尽了一切​
[01:00.778]湖水听尽了一切​
[01:05.278]湖水听尽了一切​
[01:09.432]今日的我有几分倦​
[01:13.866]只想酌几杯酒​
[01:16.197]而后洗衣晾衣​
[01:19.818]再无半点挂碍地，沉沉睡上许久​
[01:29.024]意识慢慢沉进黑暗​
[01:33.365]身体逐渐变得麻痹​
[01:38.637]灵魂徐徐归来​
[01:46.669]意识醒转​
[01:49.770]身体恢复​
[01:55.591]灵魂归位​
[01:59.444]此刻我要对着这湖水唱一支歌​
